-7d55-82a5-2b2ecc9483c5","description":"Taiwan","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae21-7032-bbf9-5198c6a09bfc","description":"Arg\u00e9lia","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae21-75eb-8355-685f1356dc3a","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7c16-9b72-2e444808bbc8","question":"O que os Amish costumam usar, tradicionalmente, no lugar de bot\u00f5es para fechar casacos e coletes?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Os Amish fecham casacos e coletes com ganchos e ilh\u00f3s, em vez de bot\u00f5es, que consideram meramente decorativos.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae21-7daa-bba7-b7349c6701c9","description":"Ganchos e ilh\u00f3s","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae21-77f8-9b8e-3ab6e8eab6a0","description":"Fivelas","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae21-7441-995b-d08ce346ea16","description":"Cadar\u00e7os","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae21-72f3-bb20-0598b4d000e0","description":"Z\u00edperes","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae21-7a35-b89a-0063ce89a5f8","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7c16-9b72-2e444808bbc8","question":"Qual destes \u00e9 um modelo de carro fabricado pela Alfa Romeo?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"A Alfa Romeo utilizou pela primeira vez o nome Giulietta para um carro compacto na d\u00e9cada de 1950 e, posteriormente, o retomou para modelos mais recentes.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae21-714c-b3c8-befa53ff4d19","description":"Giulietta","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae21-712f-9598-8aa40d03ad8c","description":"Polo","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae21-7074-a412-56f7856a967a","description":"Camry","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae21-7069-a346-8bf65940545d","description":"Quattro","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae21-7fdc-a5fe-5ef4cd91d5e7","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7c16-9b72-2e444808bbc8","question":"Quais s\u00e3o os tr\u00eas deuses que comp\u00f5em a Trimurti hindu?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Brahma est\u00e1 associado \u00e0 cria\u00e7\u00e3o, Vishnu \u00e0 preserva\u00e7\u00e3o e Shi